WEBVTT

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:13.490
Shouken's body will unlock 
the mirror of the underworld.

00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:15.990
We'll touch him at the same time.

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:30.000
What's going on? Something is off.

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:32.380
I feel a strange shaking.

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:33.550
This is...

00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:38.890
<b>Heart</b>

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:42.480
<i>The soul-binding circle has been broken.</i>

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:44.350
Shouken.

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:46.980
It's time to go home with me.

00:01:00.190 --> 00:01:01.490
Why am I here again?

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:06.000
What's your name?

00:01:06.470 --> 00:01:09.330
My name is Shinryuu Shouken.

00:01:10.490 --> 00:01:12.000
<i>Shouken...</i>

00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:25.600
<i>~Bond of the Underworld~</i>

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:47.680
Episode 9
His True Identity

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:52.630
<i>I am Shinryuu Shouken.</i>

00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:55.980
<i>I was born into the venerable Shinryuu family 
who are well-versed with medicinal herbs.</i>

00:02:56.810 --> 00:02:59.490
<i>My brother had been hard on 
me ever since I was young,</i>

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:02.380
<i>but I believed it was for the 
sake of the Shinryuu family.</i>

00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:07.450
<i>But then my brother</i>

00:03:08.110 --> 00:03:11.460
<i>told me that there would an important
 mission for me in the future,</i>

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:13.390
<i>and that's when I knew:</i>

00:03:13.390 --> 00:03:16.960
<i>My purpose was to protect someone.</i>

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:20.540
<i>My father was the head of the Shinryuu family</i>

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:24.970
<i>and everyone spoiled me because
 I was the youngest in the family.</i>

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:28.470
<i>When my parents left this world, 
my brother became the head.</i>

00:03:29.090 --> 00:03:35.090
<i>And I waited for the important mission
 my brother had said would come.</i>

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:38.860
<i>Finally, it came.</i>

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:43.950
I didn't expect this to come before 
you were fully grown.

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:46.260
It was originally planned for your brother,

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:49.660
but the Tanmoku family requested 
someone close to your age.

00:03:50.150 --> 00:03:53.420
My brother is an adult after all, 
and kids don't like him.

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:55.010
That's true.

00:03:55.010 --> 00:03:57.960
And he is the head, so he can't be absent.

00:03:57.960 --> 00:04:02.220
Leave it to me. I will complete 
the mission and come back.

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:06.720
You're not going to be able to come 
back so easily from this mission.

00:04:07.130 --> 00:04:10.960
The master that you will serve 
cannot leave the Tanmoku family.

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:13.480
You mustn't leave him alone for a moment.

00:04:13.950 --> 00:04:15.480
Please call me from time to time.

00:04:16.090 --> 00:04:20.230
Brother told me not to use the 
phone since it could be bugged.

00:04:20.590 --> 00:04:22.390
Just to chat should be fine.

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:25.690
Okay, then. Will you be married to 
my brother by the time I get back?

00:04:25.690 --> 00:04:27.250
Don't be ridiculous.

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:30.450
Shouken.

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:34.460
This is the key to our home. 
Keep it with you.

00:04:35.690 --> 00:04:38.950
I will be waiting here for your return.

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:40.960
Okay.

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:46.470
<i>But this would be the last time 
I would ever see this sight.</i>

00:04:47.110 --> 00:04:51.090
<i>Because I would never be able 
to come back here again.</i>

00:04:54.950 --> 00:04:58.480
<i>The great Tanmoku family has a
 history of over a thousand years.</i>

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:01.480
<i>They have been producing 
Youmeishi for generations.</i>

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:06.450
<i>And the current Youmeishi has the 
strongest spiritual powers in the world.</i>

00:05:06.930 --> 00:05:10.450
<i>It is said that he completes 
every ceremony perfectly.</i>

00:05:11.270 --> 00:05:14.960
<i>And my mission was to protect him.</i>

00:05:17.070 --> 00:05:24.560
<i>That legendary Youmeishi was even 
more pure and gentle than I had imagined.</i>

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:29.470
<i>Without a hint of impurity, 
it was as if he was a fairy.</i>

00:05:31.190 --> 00:05:32.470
What's your name?

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:34.480
My name is Shinryuu Shouken.

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:36.480
I am your bodyguard.

00:05:37.530 --> 00:05:42.490
<i>As of this moment, he became the 
most important person in my life.</i>

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:45.490
How dare you steal my things?!

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:48.450
I-I didn't.

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:53.950
<i>Since he wasn't part of the main family,
 he was often treated unfairly.</i>

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:55.270
Don't try to play dumb.

00:05:55.270 --> 00:05:56.380
Give it back already.

00:05:56.380 --> 00:05:58.460
I didn't steal anything.

00:05:58.460 --> 00:05:59.880
How dare you?!

00:06:00.850 --> 00:06:02.880
Let go of me.

00:06:03.360 --> 00:06:07.010
Protecting the young master 
is my duty. Please forgive me.

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:10.770
Looking for something?

00:06:12.130 --> 00:06:16.840
Jiun was probably upset because she lost the
 hair ornament which is important to her.

00:06:16.840 --> 00:06:20.890
She comes here a lot to read, so I figure
 she might have dropped it here.

00:06:20.890 --> 00:06:24.010
You are going to help her even 
though she falsely accused you?

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:26.360
I knew it'd be here.

00:06:27.580 --> 00:06:29.350
Shouken, see?

00:06:31.810 --> 00:06:33.250
Please excuse me.

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:35.450
We have a favor to ask of Ki-sama.

00:06:36.030 --> 00:06:38.450
Will you give this to Jiun for me?

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:39.170
Yes.

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:48.440
<i>Young master is too pure.</i>

00:06:48.440 --> 00:06:51.780
<i>If I gave this to her, it would 
be like admitting he stole it.</i>

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:55.470
<i>I will have to think of another 
way to give it to her.</i>

00:06:57.290 --> 00:07:01.610
My, I was wondering who the 
beautiful girl crying by herself was.

00:07:01.610 --> 00:07:03.460
So it is you, my lady.

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:09.500
Still unable to find your hair ornament?

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:11.010
Leave me alone.

00:07:11.010 --> 00:07:14.500
I can find it for you. Please tell me.

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:17.300
This has nothing to do you.
You're his bodyguard.

00:07:18.510 --> 00:07:19.960
That is unfortunate.

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:23.080
The Shinryuu family is rather 
good at finding treasure.

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:26.530
But if you would rather I didn't,
 then please excuse me.

00:07:26.530 --> 00:07:27.590
Wait!

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:30.990
I won't forgive you if 
you're unable to find it.

00:07:31.710 --> 00:07:32.970
Leave it to me.

00:07:36.090 --> 00:07:39.060
Hey, how much longer?
 I've been waiting forever.

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:40.770
Please wait a bit more.

00:07:43.380 --> 00:07:45.830
Some treasure finder he is.

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:48.900
Is this it?

00:07:54.940 --> 00:07:57.370
That's it. Thank goodness.

00:07:59.860 --> 00:08:02.870
You really won't be my bodyguard?

00:08:03.490 --> 00:08:06.880
Forgive me, but I protect the Youmeishi.

00:08:07.450 --> 00:08:10.380
What if I became the Youmeishi?

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:16.390
If I became the Youmeishi, 
would you be by my side?

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:20.970
Probably.

00:08:21.900 --> 00:08:28.330
<i>At the time, I didn't know that such a casual 
response would invite a huge disaster.</i>

00:08:30.260 --> 00:08:34.620
You know you are not supposed 
to eat food made by other people.

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:37.820
I thought it'd be fine if 
I just ate a little bit.

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:44.930
She came from so far away,
 so I didn't want to disappoint her.

00:08:44.930 --> 00:08:45.830
Young master.

00:08:46.490 --> 00:08:51.060
<i>His body was so weak that it seemed like 
it would break just by touching it.</i>

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:56.340
<i>How could he bear such a heavy 
burden with such a weak body?</i>

00:08:57.190 --> 00:09:00.670
Did you think such things when 
you were standing at the altar?

00:09:02.050 --> 00:09:06.410
Is it worth sacrificing yourself 
to make someone else happy?

00:09:07.820 --> 00:09:09.360
That's not it.

00:09:10.030 --> 00:09:12.350
I've never thought of it as a sacrifice.

00:09:13.770 --> 00:09:16.590
It makes me glad when everyone feels happy.

00:09:16.590 --> 00:09:19.580
My heart is full when I am
offering up my prayers.

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:26.060
I am content when I can listen 
and respond to everyone's wishes.

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:28.380
<i>That's when I understood.</i>

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:32.370
<i>Neither observation nor guidance 
had any meaning for him.</i>

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:37.650
<i>His thoughts far exceed our imagination.</i>

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:43.850
<i>I felt as though I knew why god would 
give him such unsuitable power.</i>

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:51.230
<i>God trusts him and he deserves 
to be trusted by god.</i>

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:55.240
<i>The next day, I sent my first secret 
message to the Shinryuu family.</i>

00:09:56.170 --> 00:10:01.200
<i>I simply said that he was 
the natural-born Youmeishi.</i>

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:10.890
<i>His body was still growing,
but it was already beginning to wear out.</i>

00:10:10.890 --> 00:10:15.620
<i>He started taking the medicine he 
took after the ceremonies every day.</i>

00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:17.950
<i>When the ceremonies were over,</i>

00:10:17.950 --> 00:10:22.090
<i>all the wishes and thoughts of 
the spirits weighed heavily on him.</i>

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:32.480
<i>He could have refused them, but he never did.</i>

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:37.470
What are you doing, young master?

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:41.450
I'm writing down the wishes 
I heard during the ceremony.

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:43.840
Have you always done this?

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:46.670
I grant what wishes I can.

00:10:47.100 --> 00:10:53.710
I write down the ones I'm not able to grant 
so that I can grant them... someday...

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:59.010
It is impossible for even 
god to make everyone happy.

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:00.070
Shouken.

00:11:00.070 --> 00:11:02.090
Please listen to me.

00:11:02.610 --> 00:11:09.250
Every spring, in the mountains where I lived, 
the fish swim upstream to lay their eggs.

00:11:10.580 --> 00:11:13.410
That is the time when bears
 wake up from hibernation.

00:11:13.970 --> 00:11:17.610
The bears will decide on a 
target and eat it with a snap

00:11:18.870 --> 00:11:22.960
as the fish jump up.

00:11:22.960 --> 00:11:24.370
Because that is their meal.

00:11:24.720 --> 00:11:26.180
Do you understand?

00:11:26.730 --> 00:11:32.620
The fish wants to go upstream and 
the bear wants to fill its stomach.

00:11:32.620 --> 00:11:36.020
The bear will starve to death
 if the fish's wish is granted,

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:39.010
and the fish will be annihilated 
if it is reversed.

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:42.980
You do not need to grant every wish.

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:46.510
Then what should I do?

00:11:47.210 --> 00:11:48.970
Express them.

00:11:49.410 --> 00:11:53.390
Listen to their voices, 
and comfort and purify them.

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:57.230
That is the Youmeishi's duty.

00:12:00.550 --> 00:12:03.350
Thank you, Shouken.

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:09.450
<i>Two years after coming to the Tanmoku 
family, I received my first order.</i>

00:12:10.850 --> 00:12:16.460
<i>"Make Tanmoku Ki the head of the family." 
But he wasn't suited to be the head.</i>

00:12:17.060 --> 00:12:19.140
<i>Nevertheless, I had to complete my mission.</i>

00:12:19.140 --> 00:12:22.590
<i>Otherwise the entire purpose of 
my being there would be lost.</i>

00:12:23.890 --> 00:12:28.180
<i>The balance of power had to be maintained 
in order to balance his authority</i>

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:30.890
<i>and to secure the position of 
the Shinryuu family as well.</i>

00:12:32.450 --> 00:12:35.440
This is a storehouse management problem, 
right? So stop trying to blame my store!

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:37.240
The medicinal ingredients 
are bought all at once

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:38.440
and the main Tanmoku family 
is also using the same things,

00:12:38.790 --> 00:12:40.570
so it's clearly an issue on your end!

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:43.570
Are you trying to say we 
switched out the medicine?

00:12:44.710 --> 00:12:47.450
I heard the people who took 
medicine from the shop died.

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:48.800
Really?

00:12:48.800 --> 00:12:55.350
<i>I can complete my mission by letting 
everyone know that the young master is wise.</i>

00:12:56.080 --> 00:12:58.740
Have you realized something, young master?

00:13:01.470 --> 00:13:03.090
Do you know something?

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:06.090
W-Well...

00:13:10.710 --> 00:13:13.560
<i>The acting head must be 
involved in this incident.</i>

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:17.380
<i>If we could cause his downfall here, 
then that would be better for the future.</i>

00:13:17.380 --> 00:13:19.060
<i>We can kill two birds with one stone.</i>

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:21.130
Please open the door. We are 
conducting an investigation.

00:13:21.130 --> 00:13:24.010
You're making all kinds of noise 
with the shouting. What is it?

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:27.820
<i>The reason I chose the Sekisui case was</i>

00:13:28.180 --> 00:13:31.090
<i>because the fate of Sekisui and 
the young master were similar.</i>

00:13:31.930 --> 00:13:33.810
<i>Sacrificing themselves to help others,</i>

00:13:33.810 --> 00:13:36.560
<i>and even though they were surround 
by many who wanted things,</i>

00:13:36.560 --> 00:13:39.290
<i>they couldn't get an understanding 
of those they love.</i>

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:42.960
Stop!

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:45.670
Only the head can touch it.

00:13:46.330 --> 00:13:50.140
But you have touched it too, 
haven't you, acting head?

00:13:51.980 --> 00:13:54.850
Don't go getting all cocky, 
you lowly bodyguard!

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:56.270
Get out!

00:13:58.190 --> 00:13:59.270
Shouken!

00:14:00.140 --> 00:14:02.770
<i>I used his kindness towards me.</i>

00:14:03.550 --> 00:14:06.640
<i>I had to find the opportunities 
to strongly give his back a push,</i>

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:08.780
<i>otherwise he would never 
take one step forward.</i>

00:14:10.380 --> 00:14:12.350
I am the Youmeishi.

00:14:12.350 --> 00:14:15.630
I could become the head of 
the family, if I so desired!

00:14:18.430 --> 00:14:19.730
<i>That's right.</i>

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:22.130
<i>One day...</i>

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:26.670
<i>the entire nation will come 
to respect and adore him.</i>

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:37.770
It's just like you said, Shouken.
 I need power.

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:43.900
In order to realize the 
ideals I have in my heart.

00:14:44.540 --> 00:14:47.890
That is why I have decided to become
 the head of the Tanmoku family.

00:14:52.510 --> 00:14:57.700
I will lay down my life to 
help you realize your dream.

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:08.970
Shouken, will this make you happy?

00:15:11.150 --> 00:15:13.390
Have I become the person you hoped?

00:15:14.950 --> 00:15:20.630
<i>It was then that a shock ran through 
my heart as if I'd been shot.</i>

00:15:21.650 --> 00:15:25.890
<i>I had forgotten that he was the Youmeishi.</i>

00:15:26.450 --> 00:15:29.650
<i>He is the Youmeishi who 
grants the wishes of souls.</i>

00:15:30.890 --> 00:15:39.390
<i>I hadn't been desperately trying 
to realize his wish, but my own.</i>

00:15:41.260 --> 00:15:44.420
<i>All that time, I thought I was
the one protecting him,</i>

00:15:45.060 --> 00:15:47.970
<i>but in reality I was the one being protected.</i>

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:50.550
<i>He saw right through me.</i>

00:15:52.050 --> 00:15:54.350
<i>To the wish deep within my eyes.</i>

00:15:55.820 --> 00:16:00.520
<i>I thought I was the only person in the 
world who didn't want anything from him.</i>

00:16:01.470 --> 00:16:05.470
<i>But even I wasn't an exception.</i>

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:11.950
<i>Suddenly I felt scared.</i>

00:16:12.770 --> 00:16:16.950
<i>When he got up on that altar,
I could only look on from afar.</i>

00:16:17.540 --> 00:16:21.420
<i>I couldn't touch him even 
if I reached out my hand.</i>

00:16:28.950 --> 00:16:32.470
Master, a relationship with 
a person is like a kite.

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:35.370
It won't fly high if you 
hold it too tightly.

00:16:35.810 --> 00:16:37.830
Loosen your grip too much and it falls.

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:42.430
And when you pull strongly on 
a kite flying high in the sky,

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:46.940
the string will snap and 
it will never come back.

00:16:47.870 --> 00:16:49.940
Yeah, there's a lot to flying kites.

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:52.950
<i>My brother taught me many different things,</i>

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:56.450
<i>but he never taught me 
how to care for someone.</i>

00:16:59.460 --> 00:17:01.510
This is where the internment camp was.

00:17:01.510 --> 00:17:05.330
Shouken's letter said 
that he had demolished it.

00:17:06.020 --> 00:17:07.330
My lord...

00:17:08.390 --> 00:17:10.460
My lord, we have found Shouken-sama.

00:17:11.060 --> 00:17:12.960
<i>I'm sorry, brother.</i>

00:17:12.960 --> 00:17:14.970
<i>I disobeyed your orders.</i>

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:19.930
<i>I took him to school, made friends 
my age, and formed a band.</i>

00:17:20.300 --> 00:17:24.500
<i>I don't really know anymore if this 
is what he wanted or what I wanted.</i>

00:17:25.110 --> 00:17:27.190
<i>But that doesn't matter.</i>

00:17:27.860 --> 00:17:33.110
<i>It was enough that he was able to 
laugh like a normal person beside me.</i>

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:34.610
What were you thinking?!

00:17:34.610 --> 00:17:37.250
These are your dismissal papers.

00:17:37.250 --> 00:17:40.620
If you step out of line again, you will take 
that back to the Shinryuu family!

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:46.620
<i>Master was supposed to go on stage that day.</i>

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:49.710
Tanmoku Ki! Tanmoku Ki! Tanmoku Ki!

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:53.990
Tanmoku Ki! Tanmoku Ki! Tanmoku Ki!

00:17:50.390 --> 00:17:51.610
Why isn't he here?

00:17:51.610 --> 00:17:53.590
We came here to see him.

00:17:53.990 --> 00:18:00.020
Tanmoku Ki! Tanmoku Ki! Tanmoku Ki!

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:55.660
Even though it's raining.

00:17:55.660 --> 00:17:57.180
How long is he going to make us wait?

00:17:57.180 --> 00:17:58.130
Let's just go.

00:17:58.130 --> 00:18:00.530
How lame. We came all this way to hear him.

00:18:02.610 --> 00:18:04.930
<i>Master is very punctual.</i>

00:18:05.580 --> 00:18:08.940
<i>If he hasn't gotten here by now, 
that means he won't come.</i>

00:18:10.450 --> 00:18:14.580
<i>Ultimately, not a single person 
heard him sing.</i>

00:18:15.140 --> 00:18:18.300
<i>But I couldn't leave behind his song.</i>

00:18:21.320 --> 00:18:29.190
<i>The wind blows past my ears 
and carries the kite far into the distance</i>

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:35.360
<i>Time quietly flows as I grasp the string in my hand</i>

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:44.160
<i>The moment I put my strength
 into it, I bid farewell to the past</i>

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:50.410
<i>And take a journey into the endless sky</i>

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:56.420
<i>Glittering light like countless galaxies</i>

00:18:56.570 --> 00:19:02.220
<i>Your eyes seek the same freedom as I do</i>

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:08.220
<i>Putting my desires into 
song with an honest heart</i>

00:19:08.450 --> 00:19:11.310
<i>In the distant future</i>

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:14.900
<i>Who will be by my side?</i>

00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:17.980
<i>The wind makes a sound</i>

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:23.660
<i>As it goes by</i>

00:19:27.020 --> 00:19:29.870
<i>You are there</i>

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:35.040
<i>By my side</i>

00:19:40.460 --> 00:19:41.550
<i>Shouken.</i>

00:19:42.290 --> 00:19:46.740
<i>Just listen to what I have to say. 
You don't need to respond.</i>

00:19:46.740 --> 00:19:51.670
<i>Two months ago, 3,876 people 
committed suicide by mass immolation.</i>

00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:55.250
<i>The leader was executed on the spot 
for large-scale preaching of a religion.</i>

00:19:55.250 --> 00:20:00.380
<i>One month ago, a lone extremist 
burned 21 shamans to death.</i>

00:20:00.690 --> 00:20:05.470
<i>A psychic's ability to mislead 
people is spread by their voice.</i>

00:20:06.340 --> 00:20:09.020
<i>A person with the ultimate 
psychic powers like Tanmoku Ki</i>

00:20:09.020 --> 00:20:11.650
<i>could easily make people lose all reason.</i>

00:20:12.470 --> 00:20:13.950
<i>Did you not know this?</i>

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:15.710
<i>Don't forget.</i>

00:20:16.370 --> 00:20:20.890
<i>You absolutely cannot let Tanmoku Ki 
participate in any vocal events.</i>

00:20:20.890 --> 00:20:22.820
<i>I don't need your excuses.</i>

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:23.990
But...

00:20:23.990 --> 00:20:30.970
<i>I am warning you, the observer cannot 
have any personal feelings for the Youmeishi.</i>

00:20:30.970 --> 00:20:34.300
<i>Don't make the same mistake again.</i>

00:20:40.830 --> 00:20:42.880
What's the observer?

00:20:43.230 --> 00:20:45.890
It's the first I've heard of it, too.

00:20:46.380 --> 00:20:47.630
Is this it?

00:20:47.630 --> 00:20:50.660
Yes, Tanmoku Ki has gone inside.

00:20:51.210 --> 00:20:52.470
Iku Sashi.

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:23.940
I've finally found you, Shouken.

00:21:23.940 --> 00:21:24.720
We have a problem!

00:21:24.720 --> 00:21:27.420
It seems we've been noticed by 
the people in the banquet hall!

00:21:27.420 --> 00:21:29.780
Buy us some time.

00:21:29.780 --> 00:21:30.590
No.

00:21:31.750 --> 00:21:33.890
Why don't we just show them?

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:39.900
All the bigwigs are gathered here.

00:21:40.540 --> 00:21:42.260
It's a great opportunity.

00:21:42.860 --> 00:21:45.360
To show them all the dirty 
things the proudly influential

00:21:45.360 --> 00:21:49.370
Tanmoku family has been 
doing behind the scenes.

00:23:25.980 --> 00:23:40.000
Next Episode
Preview

00:23:27.260 --> 00:23:30.150
You're true identity is that of the observer.

00:23:30.150 --> 00:23:33.930
If my mission was just to observe, then 
why did I do something like that?!

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:36.970
If you cannot complete it,
 then take your own life.

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.000
<b>Secret Feelings</b>

00:23:36.970 --> 00:23:40.000
That's why I wanted to send eternity to you.
